<title>UK: Courtaulds Textiles sees H2 profis up on '95.</title>
<headline>Courtaulds Textiles sees H2 profis up on '95.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Courtaulds Textiles Plc said on Friday that it expects its pre-exceptional profit before tax for the second half of 1996 to be slightly ahead of the figure for the same period in 1995.</p>
</text>
